{
  "installer": [
    "bash",
    "<PKG>/install.sh"
  ],
  "runs": [
    {
      "args": [
        "--update",
        "--target",
        "<ROOT>",
        "--no-skill",
        "--no-patch",
        "--no-wiring"
      ],
      "exit": 2,
      "output": [
        "atlas updater (刷新工程线束)",
        "  包目录 : <PKG>",
        "  目标项目: <ROOT>",
        "",
        "  [WARN] 装配触点存在未跟踪项： .atlas/——git 对未跟踪触点无改动基线可保护，",
        "         摘要不可核（副本无 .atlas/VERSION 或源包摘要不可算）——覆盖自负。",
        "         副本侧若有未回灌的本地改动，覆盖即丢失：先按 ATLAS-UPSTREAM.md 回灌",
        "         （scripts/backflow.py 三态对账）再刷新更稳。",
        "警告：未探测到任何平台 skill 目录，默认创建 .agents/skills/。",
        "  资产根   : product",
        "  ADR 根   : product/adr",
        "",
        "错误：目标存在未关闭的消融事务（ablation active）；先运行 ablation restore；",
        "      确需覆盖：--force + ATLAS_ALLOW_ABLATION_OVERWRITE=1（会放弃消融现场）。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "scenario": "ablation-active",
  "tree": {
    "dirs": [
      ".atlas",
      ".trellis"
    ],
    "files": {
      ".atlas/ABLATION": "ccfc20bde1b7de44cd03792bd531427a3c0c3aa9f821db2192aa96259b9e0da6",
      "a.txt": "7aa7a5359173d05b63cfd682e3c38487f3cb4f7f1d60659fe59fab1505977d4c"
    }
  }
}
